  "description": "This large open plan 1 bedroomed apartment ideally located in the heart of Dublin 18 Business District.\n\nThis bright and airy apartment is located on the 3rd floor and briefly comprises, entrance hall with storage room, living / dining room, with spacious balcony, kitchen with integrated appliances, large double bedroom with built in mirrored wardrobes and attractive modern bathroom. Secure underground car parking space for 1 vehicle.\n\nThe Forum on Ballymoss Road offers superb convenience with local amenities such as supermarkets, restaurants gyms and nearby Luas Green Line right on your doorstep providing fast and convenient access to Dublin City Centre, Dundrum Town Centre, Cherrywood and beyond.\n\n",
